     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The members that two sets have in common are included in the intersection of the sets. Only element <i>a</i> is in both sets.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A \\cap B = \\left\\{ a \\right\\}\"></span></p>"
    },
